19	// per-bucket counts, whole-window totals, the resolved height range, and the
20	// missing-time-block count — must come from that same complete chain. And a
21	// snapshot whose invalidity (a negative timestamp) only surfaces in its very
22	// last block must leave the old chain bit-for-bit in effect.
